cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Spectroscopic Recovery of Changing-Look AGN
version: 1.1.1
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a counterfactual experiment measuring how spectroscopic
  signal-to-noise and the operational classification protocol affect recovery of
  58 published changing-look AGN transitions.
